# On-demand plugin checkout

1. Meta repo path: `~/workspace/agent-plugins` (clone from `https://github.com/tingaidehua/agent-plugins`).
2. **Default: zero `plugin-*` checkouts.** Do not clone, submodule, or sparse-checkout plugins unless the user explicitly names which ones.
3. When cloning, put repos at `~/workspace/agent-plugins/<plugin-name>` matching the GitHub repo name. Respect deps in `docs/PLUGINS.md`.
4. Install into DeepSeek Harness with **junction / `dsh plugin add <path>`** pointing at that source tree — never copy snapshots for daily use.
5. Follow `docs/INSTALL.md` and `AGENTS.md`.
